# 80 MB of k-NN reference vectors, and the serving path never opens them.
# The support gate runs at database *build* time (store.py's
# add_counterfactuals, reached only from build_database / `make serve-db`),
# which happens on a workstation before the image is built. What the running
# API does is read artifacts/xdr.duckdb, where the gate's verdicts are
# already recorded per option.
#
# This is 87% of the artifacts payload. Leave it out unless a route starts
# scoring candidates live, at which point it has to come back -- the image
# would otherwise fail at first request, not at build.
artifacts/support_index.joblib
